                "category": "interaction",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>A melixie can communicate with arthropods, such as insects, spiders, scorpions, crabs, and similar invertebrate animals. They can use Diplomacy to [[/act make-an-impression]] on arthropods and [[/act request]] things from arthropods.</p>"
